      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is happening to me but I'm using virtual desktop and Oculus quest 2. It happens when I disconnect from virtual desktop eaither by going afk, or connection drop by internet. Once I return my audio device list is gone on vrchat and it only solves by restart of client. For me this has only been happening since the beginning of this week.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
